{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260BgFH61sKh1793112516.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>可口可樂上季業績好過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>第三季盈利40億美元，按年增長百分之8.4。可比每股盈利91美仙，高過市場預期的88美仙。期內，收入133.8億美元，上升百分之7.4。主要由濃縮產品銷售等因素帶動。</p><p></p><p>集團上調全年可比每股盈利預測，由按年增長百分之9至10，上調到至少增長百分之11。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:48.116931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.364741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:21.616796+00:00","content_hash":"f22a63eeec186af392578a52f7768c6d6ca86f4537dd41c8721dbd872db912af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:48.116931+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}